Package: drcTMB
Title: Fitting Dose-Response Curves Using the Template Model Builder
Version: 0.0.0.9940
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Gerhard", , "00gerhard@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9336-3454"))
Description: Fits non-linear dose-response models, optionally with
    random effects, by maximum likelihood using the Template Model Builder
    ('TMB'), with the Laplace approximation for the random effects. The
    log-logistic, Weibull, hormesis and threshold models of the 'drc' package
    are available, and the response can follow a Gaussian, Poisson, binomial,
    beta, beta-binomial or negative binomial distribution. Effective doses
    and their standard errors are derived by automatic differentiation.
